PUT_FILES_HERE/*
!PUT_FILES_HERE/README.md

# ISO/IEC/IEEE standards are copyright-protected reference material, not repo
# artifacts (spec 2026-08-27-tc-rubric-design 2.1). The rubric derived from
# them IS tracked, at standards/rubric/.
#
# Ignore EVERYTHING under standards/ and re-include only the rubric directory.
# `standards/*.pdf` was neither recursive nor format-agnostic: a nested
# standards/29119/*.pdf, or a .docx / .zip copy of the same document, would
# have been committed. The copyright constraint is the whole reason this line
# exists, so it defaults to deny.
standards/**
!standards/rubric/
!standards/rubric/**
